flowchart TD
  T[Start tick] --> L[Collect READY patients]
  L --> E{Any READY?}
  E -->|no| I[Log IDLE / stuck check]
  E -->|yes| P[Pick least remaining]
  P --> K[Tie: higher severity then lower ID]
  K --> X{Different unfinished previous patient?}
  X -->|yes| PRE[Log PREEMPT]
  X -->|no| GO[Post go]
  PRE --> GO
  GO --> WAIT[Wait done]
  WAIT --> REC[Record Gantt]
  I --> INC[Increment tick]
  REC --> INC
